{
  "version": 1,
  "source": "r/DiscordQuests community path index",
  "comment": [
    "Community-verified folder structures. These win over paths derived from",
    "Discord's detectable list, because they are what people confirmed working.",
    "'path' is relative to the emulation root; forward slashes are normalised",
    "to the platform separator at build time.",
    "'alts' are additional accepted paths. 'note' explains any deviation from",
    "the wiki text. 'template' marks paths containing {placeholders}.",
    "'standalone' marks a game Discord lists with no executables of its own,",
    "so this entry is the only path data that exists for it.",
    "'aliases' feed the search index only."
  ],
